{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Small creatures, but massive destruction!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b514673eb39ef597b0b4154e329aaee2.poster.avif?t=1751620527\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b514673eb39ef597b0b4154e329aaee2.webm?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b514673eb39ef597b0b4154e329aaee2.mp4?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this colorful <i>survivors-like</i>, summon your trusted allies, the <strong>Chuminis</strong>, to battle hords of forest demons! It\u2019s up to you to manage each Chumini\u2019s <strong>unique behavior</strong> to survive for 20 minutes, and defeat the Evil Shaman. They\u2019re 12  different Chuminis to choose from: find the <strong>best synergies</strong> that suit your playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/89e1ae997c7cc27ec3da99843133d105.poster.avif?t=1751620527\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/89e1ae997c7cc27ec3da99843133d105.webm?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/89e1ae997c7cc27ec3da99843133d105.mp4?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience from the defeated demons, build your army of powerful allies and upgrade them to survive! Some Chuminis will run in a circle around you, others will follow your every step\u2026 <strong>Optimize your movement to take advantage of your allies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b030fca4b008e4970597adef4644c0b1.poster.avif?t=1751620527\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b030fca4b008e4970597adef4644c0b1.webm?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/b030fca4b008e4970597adef4644c0b1.mp4?t=1751620527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different creatures to summon, upgrade, and use in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique enemies and 2 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful hand-drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta-progression system offering replayability and difficulty levels!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310000?t=1751620527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751620527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/e9d84a595252d97f6acffaf407b0fa0a110a4d50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751620527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/e9d84a595252d97f6acffaf407b0fa0a110a4d50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751620527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67